":\"/graph/inferences/2/argument/3/objects/-\",\"value\":\"Φ\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/2/argument/4/objects/-\",\"value\":\"μ\"},{\"op\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/argument/1/produces/0\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"F002\",\"statement\":\"There exist families q0,u0,η0 indexed by the chosen nonempty finite family g, a minimum κ0∈ℤ and an index jmin of g such that every q0_j is a nonzero rational, every u0_j is a unit of R, every η0_j is an integer, g_j=q0_j a=p^{η0_j}u0_j a, κ0≤η0_j for every j, and η0_jmin=κ0.\",\"binders\":[{\"symbol\":\"q0\",\"type\":\"family of nonzero rationals indexed by g\"},{\"symbol\":\"u0\",\"type\":\"family of units of R indexed by g\"},{\"symbol\":\"η0\",\"type\":\"family of integers indexed by g\"},{\"symbol\":\"κ0\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"symbol\":\"jmin\",\"type\":\"index of g\"}],\"objects\":[\"g\",\"a\",\"R\",\"p\",\"q0\",\"u0\",\"η0\",\"κ0\",\"jmin\"],\"assumptions\":[]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"ν\",\"type\":\"integer\",\"scope\":\"minimum exponent\",\"start\":\"S003\",\"end\":\"S003\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose the minimum exponent ν=κ0 furnished by F002 together with its families and minimizing index.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F002\"],\"objects\":[\"g\",\"p\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"νexp\",\"type\":\"family of integers indexed by g\",\"scope\":\"minimum exponent\",\"start\":\"S003\",\"end\":\"S003\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose the exponent family νexp from F002, simultaneously with ν,u,j_0; write its j-th entry as ν_j.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F002\"],\"objects\":[\"g\",\"p\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"u\",\"type\":\"family of units of R indexed by g\",\"scope\":\"minimum exponent\",\"start\":\"S003\",\"end\":\"S003\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose the family u of units from F002 simultaneously with ν,νexp,j_0.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F002\"],\"objects\":[\"g\",\"R\",\"p\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"j_0\",\"type\":\"index of g\",\"scope\":\"minimum exponent\",\"start\":\"S003\",\"end\":\"S003\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose the minimizing index j_0 from F002 simultaneously with ν,νexp,u, so ν_{j_0}=ν.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F002\"],\"objects\":[\"g\",\"p\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"b\",\"type\":\"complex number\",\"scope\":\"principal generator\",\"start\":\"S003\",\"end\":\"S003\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"declaration\":\"Define b=p^ν a.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[],\"objects\":[\"p\",\"ν\",\"a\"]}},{\"op\":\"replace_text\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/argument/2/text\",\"old\":\"Using the notation quantified in F002, put b=p^ν a=u_{j_0}^{-1}g_{j_0}.\",\"new\":\"Choose simultaneously from F002 the exponent family νexp (entries ν_j), the unit family u, the minimum ν and an attaining index j_0. Put b=p^ν a=u_{j_0}^{-1}g_{j_0}.\"},{\"op\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/3/argument/2/objects\",\"value\":[\"a\",\"g\",\"J\",\"p\",\"R\",\"M_R\",\"e\",\"I\",\"n\",\"ν\",\"νexp\",\"u\",\"j_0\",\"b\"]},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"A\",\"type\":\"K-linear map V(K)→M_R⊗_R K\",\"scope\":\"first tensor identification\",\"start\":\"S001\",\"end\":\"S004\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"declaration\":\"Define A(m⊗c)=(1⊗m)⊗c by tensor balancing, as checked in S001.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[],\"objects\":[\"M\",\"M_R\",\"R\",\"K\",\"V(K)\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"B\",\"type\":\"K-linear map M_R⊗_R K→(M_R/pM_R)⊗_{ℱ_p}K\",\"scope\":\"quotient tensor identification\",\"start\":\"S002\",\"end\":\"S004\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"declaration\":\"Define B(u⊗c)=[u]⊗c by the balanced quotient map, as checked in S002.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F001\"],\"objects\":[\"M_R\",\"R\",\"K\",\"p\",\"ρ\"]}},{\"op\":\"remove\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/0/produces/0/binders/0\"},{\"op\":\"remove\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/1/produces/0/binders/0\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/0/objects/-\",\"value\":\"A\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/1/objects/-\",\"value\":\"B\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/2/objects/-\",\"value\":\"A\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/3/objects/-\",\"value\":\"A\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/3/objects/-\",\"value\":\"B\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"T\",\"type\":\"family of K-linear coordinate endomorphisms indexed by I×I\",\"scope\":\"reduced matrix units\",\"start\":\"S005\",\"end\":\"S005\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"declaration\":\"For i,j∈I define T_ij relative to the K-basis β by T_ij β_k=β_i for k=j and zero otherwise.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F003\"],\"objects\":[\"β\",\"I\",\"K\",\"V(K)\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"W\",\"type\":\"K-linear subspace of V(K)\",\"scope\":\"invariance implication\",\"start\":\"S005\",\"end\":\"S005\",\"kind\":\"arbitrary\",\"declaration\":\"Fix an arbitrary K-linear subspace W for the final quantified implication.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[],\"objects\":[\"K\",\"V(K)\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/4/objects/-\",\"value\":\"T\"},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/4/argument/4/objects/-\",\"value\":\"W\"},{\"op\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/argument/0/produces/0\",\"value\":{\"id\":\"F001\",\"statement\":\"Under L1 and L2 there exist w0∈W and coefficients c0:I→K with w0=∑_{i∈I}c0_i β_i≠0 and an index j0∈I with c0_j0≠0; W is invariant under every coordinate matrix unit on β.\",\"binders\":[{\"symbol\":\"w0\",\"type\":\"element of W\"},{\"symbol\":\"c0\",\"type\":\"family I→K\"},{\"symbol\":\"j0\",\"type\":\"element of I\"},{\"symbol\":\"i\",\"type\":\"element of I\"}],\"objects\":[\"w0\",\"W\",\"c0\",\"I\",\"K\",\"β\",\"j0\",\"i\"],\"assumptions\":[\"L1\",\"L2\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"w\",\"type\":\"element of W\",\"scope\":\"nonzero branch\",\"start\":\"S002\",\"end\":\"S002\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose a nonzero w∈W with its coordinates c and nonzero coordinate index j simultaneously from F001.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F001\"],\"objects\":[\"W\",\"I\",\"K\",\"β\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"c\",\"type\":\"family I→K\",\"scope\":\"nonzero branch\",\"start\":\"S002\",\"end\":\"S002\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose the coordinate family c simultaneously with w and j as in F001.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F001\"],\"objects\":[\"W\",\"I\",\"K\",\"β\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"j\",\"type\":\"element of I\",\"scope\":\"nonzero branch\",\"start\":\"S002\",\"end\":\"S002\",\"kind\":\"witness\",\"declaration\":\"Choose j∈I simultaneously with w,c from F001 so that c_j≠0.\",\"from_inputs\":[],\"from_local\":[\"F001\"],\"objects\":[\"W\",\"I\",\"K\",\"β\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/locals/-\",\"value\":{\"symbol\":\"T\",\"type\":\"family of coordinate matrix units on β\",\"scope\":\"irreducibility\",\"start\":\"S001\",\"end\":\"S003\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"declaration\":\"Let T_ij be the coordinate matrix units relative to β, as supplied by N005.\",\"from_inputs\":[\"N005\"],\"from_local\":[],\"objects\":[\"β\",\"K\",\"V(K)\",\"I\"]}},{\"op\":\"add\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/argument/0/objects/-\",\"value\":\"T\"},{\"op\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"/graph/inferences/5/argument/1/objects\",\"value\":[\"β\",\"W\",\"I\",\"K\",\"V(K)\",\"w\",\"c\",\"j\",\"T\"]}]}}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read one declared frozen document. For JSON use pointer (empty string lists the root); large objects return keys, and strings resume with offset=next_offset. For text use inclusive start/end lines and column=next_column when continuing a long line. Every serialized result is at most 32 KiB. Follow has_more and the returned continuation coordinates; no arbitrary local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report only a real substantive/suspected mathematical GAP, unavailable source or conflicting original input, with all five located fields. Ordinary unfinished NL0, source registration and JSON bookkeeping are not reports: continue an actual lookup or draft edit. TASK_INCOMPLETE is unavailable for NL0 authoring. Difficulty or a long run is not evidence of a mathematical gap.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["SUBSTANTIVE_GAP","SUSPECTED_GAP","SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE","INPUT_CONFLICT"]},"location":{"type":"string"},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"basis":{"type":"string"},"partial_progress":{"type":"string"}},"required":["status","location","explanation","basis","partial_progress"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of submit_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review. The optional module locator uses dotted syntax (Mathlib.Topology.Basic), never a slash path; omit it if unknown.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"declaration":{"type":"string"},"module":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","declaration"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"find_library_sources","description":"Search pinned foundational metadata by an exact declaration name or ordinary mathematical terms. Ranked lexical candidates are not a theorem whitelist or an applicability judgment. Selected sources still need explicit M roots and complete checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_draft","description":"Read a JSON pointer in your own same-stage candidate after an actual structural check. No other file/stage is accessible. For an existing string optionally supply both start_line/end_line to request up to 250 numbered lines and its complete text_sha256 for replace_lines. A read end beyond the text returns the remaining existing lines and actual range; the start must exist. Edits never clamp their range.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"candidate":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"end_line":{"type":"integer"